  m_text: 'ATTACKERS


    Reach the END of the court and return

    to the START
    without being tagged.


    SIDE GUARDS


    Move LEFT and RIGHT along your
    yellow line.

    Use ROTATE to face the other direction.

    Press TOUCH when
    an attacker is within reach.


    MIDDLE GUARD


    Move UP and DOWN along
    the center line.

    Use ROTATE and TOUCH to tag attackers.


    ROUND TIME:
    3 MINUTES

    BEST OF 3 ROUNDS'
